{"work_id":"tirumbippaar","target_language":"en","canonical_scene":56,"scene_status":"verified","unit_count":16,"units":[{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u001","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d001","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":70,"printed_page":62}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Usha! Didn't I tell you not to go out at night! Did you listen? You go saying you're helping the poor."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u002","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d002","speaker_label":"ஊஷா","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":70,"printed_page":62}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Why keep talking about what has already happened, father? What did the police say?","notes":["The source contains an irregular word before 'பேசுகிறீர்கள்'; the familial address is rendered from the supported context without altering the Tamil source."]}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u003","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d003","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":70,"printed_page":62}]},"translation":{"english_text":"What did they say? Apparently no one has been caught!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u004","kind":"stage-direction","status":"verified","source":{"page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":70,"printed_page":62}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Paranthaman enters saying, 'He's been caught.')"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u005","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d004","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":70,"printed_page":62}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Who?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u006","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d005","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":70,"printed_page":62}]},"translation":{"english_text":"(Sitting down.) I heard everything. [Source wording irregular.] It is God who prevented the danger that befell you through Usha.","notes":["The middle phrase in the verified Tamil is corrupt/irregular and has not been silently reconstructed."]}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u007","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d006","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":70,"printed_page":62}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Leave that aside—you said the man has been caught!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u008","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d007","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Yes. This is the work of violent men who incite the workers!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u009","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d008","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Ah... a violent man!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u010","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d009","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"That man is Pandiyan."}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u011","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d010","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Pandiyan?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u012","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d011","speaker_label":"ஊஷா","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Pandiyan?"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u013","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d012","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"The very same! He has conducted an inaugural ceremony for the government. Soon he'll set fire to the mill itself. He has gathered a small gang solely to destroy you.","notes":["The unusual 'அரசாங்கத்திற்கு ஆரம்பவிழா' wording is translated closely rather than normalized."]}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u014","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d013","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Hmm! Evidence to catch him!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u015","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d014","speaker_label":"பரந்தாமன்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Evidence! My friends have informed me where the stolen diamond necklace is. His house must be searched. This must be done urgently. Phone them right now!"}},{"id":"tirumbippaar-en-s056-u016","kind":"dialogue","status":"verified","source":{"source_record_id":"tirumbippaar-s056-d015","speaker_label":"முதலாளி","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":71,"printed_page":63}]},"translation":{"english_text":"Bravo! Exactly the right idea! (He picks up the phone and speaks.) Hello! Police station!"}}]}